_8_619\" transform=\"matrix(10.5,0,0,-10.5,139.39844,21.536164)\" fill=\"#18283a\"/>\n</g>\n</svg>\n","[3,1,2] → [1,3,2] → [1,2,3]"],["heading","JAVA EXAMPLE"],["code","int[] a={3,1,2};\nfor(int i=1;i<a.length;i++){\n    int key=a[i],j=i-1;\n    while(j>=0 && a[j]>key){\n        a[j+1]=a[j]; j--;\n    }\n    a[j+1]=key;\n}\nSystem.out.println(java.util.Arrays.toString(a));"],["heading","OUTPUT AND ANALYSIS"],["text","[1, 2, 3]. Insertion worst O(n²), best O(n), O(1) extra space."],["heading","INTERVIEW QUESTION"],["heading","Which simple sort works well on nearly sorted arrays?"],["text","Insertion sort, because few shifts are needed."],["heading","PRACTICE YOURSELF"],["text","Trace selection sort on [4,2,3,1]."]]